sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Workshop as workshop skill
    participant Lead as orchestrator (lead)
    participant TR as ticket-reviewer
    participant Des as designer
    participant BE as backend-engineer
    participant FE as frontend-engineer
    participant CR as code-reviewer
    participant QA as qa-tester
    participant Writer as writer

    User->>Workshop: /workshop
    Workshop-->>User: docs/specs/<slug>.md

    User->>Lead: /orchestrator <spec>
    Lead->>Lead: 1. Prepare (write tmp/team/handoff.md)

    alt spec Type is BUG or TICKET
        Lead->>TR: verify reproduction
        TR-->>Lead: STATUS: REPRODUCED / NOT REPRODUCED / BLOCKED
        alt NOT REPRODUCED or BLOCKED
            Lead-->>User: stop, report
        end
    end

    opt UI/UX or frontend surface
        Lead->>Des: design pass
        Des-->>Lead: tmp/team/design.md
    end

    Lead->>BE: implement (backend)
    Lead->>FE: implement (frontend)
    BE-->>Lead: changes done
    FE-->>Lead: changes done

    par Review and QA (parallel)
        Lead->>CR: review-round-N
        CR-->>Lead: VERDICT: CLEAN / FINDINGS
    and
        Lead->>QA: qa-round-N
        QA-->>Lead: VERDICT: CLEAN / FINDINGS
    end

    loop until both CLEAN on same round
        Lead->>BE: route findings
        Lead->>FE: route findings
        Lead->>CR: re-review
        Lead->>QA: re-test
    end

    Lead->>Writer: document (alone)
    Writer-->>Lead: docs updated

    Lead-->>User: 6. Report (AC coverage, QA results, try-it steps)
